@startuml
title Prediction Flow — Sequence Diagram
actor User
participant "Streamlit UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI Model API" as API
participant "Model Registry" as Registry
participant "GenAI Service" as GenAI

User -> UI: submit customer data
UI -> API: POST /predict
API -> Registry: load best model
API -> Model: predict()
API -> GenAI: request explanation
GenAI -> API: explanation
API -> UI: result + confidence + explanation
@enduml